1
00:00:04,688 --> 00:00:05,418
Hey.

2
00:00:07,359 --> 00:00:11,418
Why are you putting your face so close?
Let me kiss you a bit.

3
00:00:11,418 --> 00:00:13,241
You're crazy.
What are you doing here?

4
00:00:17,560 --> 00:00:20,199
Then…

5
00:00:20,199 --> 00:00:23,080
Sleep with me tonight.

6
00:00:33,520 --> 00:00:36,453
I can't. I really have to go home.

7
00:00:37,702 --> 00:00:43,082
Aunt Air won't know. Just tell her
you're celebrating your birthday with friends.

8
00:00:44,886 --> 00:00:47,890
So you want me to lie to my mom?
That's bad behavior.

9
00:00:48,970 --> 00:00:52,212
Even if it's bad…
I'll still do it.

10
00:00:54,248 --> 00:00:58,422
As long as I get to be with you, Earth.

11
00:01:01,553 --> 00:01:03,877
I really can't stay.

12
00:01:07,532 --> 00:01:08,785
You're still mad at me?

13
00:01:10,929 --> 00:01:14,840
No… but I can't leave my mom.

14
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:21,040
Why?
Is Aunt Air okay?

15
00:01:21,040 --> 00:01:29,759
Uh… listen carefully, okay?
P'Gun, listen carefully.

16
00:01:29,759 --> 00:01:34,228
Um…
My mom is pregnant.

17
00:01:34,228 --> 00:01:37,933
Huh?
Your mom is… pregnant?
